{"unit_id":"TableRogue__dsh-message-navigator#card-zh","repo":"TableRogue/dsh-message-navigator","commit":"7233842936a6d727c07bd64d303779b375d2f787","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"Message Navigator 是一个用于 DSH 网页聊天界面的消息索引插件。它把导航条挂载到 shell.overlay，为用户和 steering 消息生成侧边标记；点击标记可平滑滚动到对应消息，当前阅读位置会同步高亮，悬停可查看消息预览。消息变化时会重扫并更新索引。适合在长对话中定位历史消息；不需要额外密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:247-285","lib/client.js:310-331","lib/client.js:364-412","lib/client.js:415-427"]}
{"unit_id":"TableRogue__dsh-message-navigator#card-en","repo":"TableRogue/dsh-message-navigator","commit":"7233842936a6d727c07bd64d303779b375d2f787","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"Message Navigator adds a side index to DSH web chats. It marks user messages, jumps to a selected message, highlights the current position, and previews text on hover. The index updates as messages change, helping users navigate long conversations. No API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:247-285","lib/client.js:310-331","lib/client.js:364-412","lib/client.js:415-427"]}
