{"unit_id":"TableRogue__dsh-message-navigator#feature-1","repo":"TableRogue/dsh-message-navigator","commit":"7233842936a6d727c07bd64d303779b375d2f787","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Message Navigator 的功能「消息标记跳转」：为聊天中的用户和 steering 消息创建侧边标记。点击标记后，页面滚动到相应消息附近；若已经在视口附近则跳过动画。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:267-285","lib/client.js:310-331"]}
{"unit_id":"TableRogue__dsh-message-navigator#feature-2","repo":"TableRogue/dsh-message-navigator","commit":"7233842936a6d727c07bd64d303779b375d2f787","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Message Navigator 的功能「阅读位置高亮」：根据滚动容器中 40% 高度处的阅读线选出当前消息，并高亮对应的侧边标记。滚动时更新高亮。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:150-175","lib/client.js:216-225"]}
{"unit_id":"TableRogue__dsh-message-navigator#feature-3","repo":"TableRogue/dsh-message-navigator","commit":"7233842936a6d727c07bd64d303779b375d2f787","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Message Navigator 的功能「消息悬停预览」：将鼠标移到侧边标记上时显示对应消息文本的 tooltip，长文本限制为两行显示。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:364-412","lib/client.js:9-29"]}
{"unit_id":"TableRogue__dsh-message-navigator#feature-4","repo":"TableRogue/dsh-message-navigator","commit":"7233842936a6d727c07bd64d303779b375d2f787","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Message Navigator 的功能「动态消息同步」：监听聊天内容变化并重新扫描用户及 steering 消息；滚动容器尺寸变化时重新测量标记位置。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:227-239","lib/client.js:247-285"]}
{"unit_id":"TableRogue__dsh-message-navigator#caveat-1","repo":"TableRogue/dsh-message-navigator","commit":"7233842936a6d727c07bd64d303779b375d2f787","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"Message Navigator 依赖页面的消息识别属性；若网页 DOM 契约变化，选择器可能需要调整。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:87-91","lib/client.js:247-278"]}
